│  dependencies.                                                              │
│    Adding BuildMethod: <runtime> triggers the pip/npm install workflow      │
│  during                                                                     │
│    sam build, installing requirements.txt deps into the python/             │
│  subdirectory.                                                              │
│    Always include Metadata: BuildMethod when the layer exists — it is       │
│  harmless                                                                   │
│    when there are no dependencies (SAM simply skips the install step).      │
│                                                                             │
│  Section H — SQS Queues (only if blueprint.sqs_queues is non-empty):        │
│    For each entry in blueprint.sqs_queues:                                  │
