│     follow the reference templates EXACTLY. Do NOT add extra YAML           │
│  properties                                                                 │
│     beyond what the reference shows. Example: if the reference Cors block   │
│  has                                                                        │
│     AllowMethods, AllowHeaders, AllowOrigin — write ONLY those three        │
│  fields.                                                                    │
